ry to practice on a daily basis, even for five minutes."], "t": 37.01, "tt": {"w": 37.01, "ex": [["On", 40.2], ["a", 40.41], ["daily", 40.55], ["basis", 40.97], ["means", 41.39], ["every", 41.8], ["day", 42.22], ["or", 42.5], ["regularly.", 42.71], ["Basis", 43.48], ["here", 43.9], ["means", 44.24], ["the", 44.66], ["way", 44.94], ["or", 45.22], ["schedule", 45.43], ["something", 46.06], ["happens", 46.75], ["on.", 47.31], ["We", 47.59], ["also", 47.8], ["say", 48.15], ["on", 48.43], ["a", 48.64], ["weekly", 48.78], ["or", 49.26], ["a", 49.47], ["regular", 49.61], ["basis.", 50.17]], "exs": [[["I", 53.91], ["talk", 54.03], ["to", 54.32], ["clients", 54.49], ["on", 54.95], ["a", 55.12], ["daily", 55.24], ["basis.", 55.59]], [["Try", 60.12], ["to", 60.37], ["practice", 60.55], ["on", 61.09], ["a", 61.27], ["daily", 61.39], ["basis,", 61.75], ["even", 62.17], ["for", 62.48], ["five", 62.72], ["minutes.", 63.02]]], "z": [56.73, 64.3], "o": 67.96}, "src": {"t": "That’s classic. That’s the marshmallow test on a daily basis.", "a": "audio/t04/s02.mp3", "hl": [49, 60], "sp": "Chris", "oa": "audio/t04o/s02.mp3", "oab": [1.86, 3.79], "oas": ["audio/t04o/s02.mp3"], "zh": "这很经典，就是每天都在做的棉花糖实验。", "zb": [7, 9]}}, {"n": 3, "w": "suffering addict", "pos": "n. phrase", "zh": "沉迷受苦的人", "ex": "An addict is someone who can't stop doing something. A suffering addict is someone who starts to need the pain itself, as if pain alone proves you're making progress. Chris says people need to avoid becoming one.", "exs": ["Don't become a suffering addict; rest is part of the plan.", "He's a bit of a workout addict."], "t": 73.15, "tt": {"w": 73.15, "ex": [["An", 76.16], ["addict", 76.34], ["is", 76.76], ["someone", 76.95], ["who", 77.43], ["can't", 77.68], ["stop", 78.04], ["doing", 78.34], ["something.", 80.99], ["A", 81.05], ["suffering", 81.11], ["addict", 81.17], ["is", 81.23], ["someone", 81.3], ["who", 81.36], ["starts", 81.42], ["to", 81.6], ["need", 81.76], ["the", 81.92], ["pain", 82.1]